{"about_the_game":"BME Pro is a powerful level editor for Ballex\u00b2, you can use it to create levels and share them to the workshop.<br />\r\nBME Pro is more focused on increasing the freedom of level makers. Compared with the Ballex1 level editor (BME3), in BME Pro you can import your own models and textures, create custom materials, import your own sound effects and music, and even write your own logic to modify the game.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nBefore using the editor, it is highly recommended to read the tutorial in detail. Please click the tutorial button in the help of the menu bar, and it will automatically jump to the tutorial page.","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1809190?t=1657079746","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1809190?t=1657079746","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1809190/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1657079746","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1809190/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1657079746","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"BME Pro is a powerful level editor for Ballex\u00b2, you can use it to create levels and share them to the workshop.<br />\r\nBME Pro is more focused on increasing the freedom of level makers. Compared with the Ballex1 level editor (BME3), in BME Pro you can import your own models and textures, create custom materials, import your own sound effects and music, and even write your own logic to modify the game.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nBefore using the editor, it is highly recommended to read the tutorial in detail. Please click the tutorial button in the help of the menu bar, and it will automatically jump to the tutorial page.","devel